               MOVE EIBCALEN TO WS-CALEN.
               SET WS-ADDR-COMMAREA TO ADDRESS OF DFHCOMMAREA.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCL00KRD-002.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCL00HLR-003.
               PERFORM CALL-ZCU0255O-004.
               PERFORM DERIVE-TAX-BAND-0001.
               PERFORM EXPAND-NCD-YEARS-0002.
               PERFORM REFRESH-EQUITIES-0003.
               PERFORM AUDIT-EQUITIES-0004.
               PERFORM COMPUTE-HOUSE-TYPE-0005.
               PERFORM DERIVE-BEDROOMS-0006.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
